### ===========================================================
### REST API Fundamentals — Example Requests
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
### Click "Send Request" above any block below to try it out.
### ===========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Root route — API info
GET {{baseUrl}}/


### Get all products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products


### Get a single product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1


### Get a product that does not exist (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/9999


### Create a new product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 79.99,
  "category": "Electronics"
}


### Create a product with missing fields (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Incomplete Product"
}


### Update a product (full update)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Laptop",
  "price": 1299,
  "category": "Electronics"
}


### Update a product (partial update)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 19.99
}


### Update a product that does not exist (expect 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 10
}


### Delete a product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/3


### Delete a product that does not exist (expect 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/9999
